OL,3,GNEWSAMPs press for faster action over
OL,4,Afuneral sector
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA cross-party group of MPs has called
OL,10,Ffor urgent government action to
OL,11,Fregulate the funeral industry following
OL,12,Fthe conviction of former Hull funeral
OL,13,Fdirector Robert Bush.
OL,15,FIn a letter to Health Secretary Yvette
OL,16,FCooper, the 50 MPs said "a regulatory
OL,17,Fblack hole" in the sector had made his
OL,18,Fcrimes possible and they warned that
OL,19,Fwithout intervention, further cases of
OL,20,F"severe negligence and abuse" were
OL,21,Finevitable.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
