OL,3,GNEWSAMPs press for faster action over
OL,4,Afuneral sector
OL,5,
OL,6,FBush, who ran Legacy Independent
OL,7,FFuneral Directors, was jailed for 20
OL,8,Fyears in July for 67 offences,
OL,9,Fincluding denying 30 people a decent
OL,10,Fand proper burial.
